test output + existing debug records\n   - Output format: hypothesis list/reproduction suggestions, each with observation evidence + inference + suggestion\n   - Role constraints: only output analysis, no changes, no file writing, exit after output\n   - Must embed SENSE method: explicitly require review debug agent to load sense skill immediately after startup from `./skill_sense.md` (hardcoded relative path, same directory as debug_skill.md)\n   - Agent reads this file, analyzes bug info using S→E→N structure before outputting hypotheses\n\n7. **Complete bug file structure example**:\n   - First line must be YAML frontmatter with three sections for each phase's records and a `## 结论` section\n\n8. **Three-phase progression diagram** (text form): Phase 1 max 3 → Phase 2 (can skip if no baseline) → Phase 3 max 5 → exceed: escalate to human\n\nNow I'm writing the complete `debug_skill.md` file.","signature":""}],"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7255c036-7280-4840-9c4e-02e78f75b3f1","uuid":"ac169d9d-ca69-4fe5-b812-288431137b3a"}
